OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry day with sunny
OL,6,Fspells and patches of fair weather
OL,7,Fcloud, with the odd shower possible.
OL,8,FAfter a cool start, any early morning
OL,9,Fmist and fog will soon lift.
OL,10,FTemperatures will rise to around
OL,11,Faverage in the sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA bright end to the day with
OL,14,Fsunny spells this evening. Remaining
OL,15,Fdry overnight with clear spells
OL,16,Fdeveloping. Rather chilly,
OL,17,Fparticularly in rural spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
