OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FDry and settled for most on
OL,6,FSunday, with plenty of late August
OL,7,Fsunshine on offer. Light winds and
OL,8,Ffeeling warm in the sunshine.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,11,FRemaining largely dry with sunny
OL,12,Fspells on Monday. Showers and possibly
OL,13,Fthunderstorms developing from Tuesday,
OL,14,Fsome locally heavy. Feeling warmer,
OL,15,Fespecially in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
